# AGENTS.local.md.example
#
# Copy to AGENTS.local.md at the repo root. That copy is gitignored and must
# never be committed. Fill values from SSM / CloudFormation after `aws login`.

# ## AWS
# Account id, region, and `aws login` notes for this desk. All three environments live in the one production AWS account (profile chatticus-production).
# Account ids, member-account ids, and billing emails stay in this file
# only. Never copy them into project/wiki or other committed docs.

# ## API bases
# aws ssm get-parameter --name /chatticus/development/thin-turn/cloudfront-url
# aws cloudformation describe-stacks --stack-name ChatticusThinTurnDevelopment \
#   --query "Stacks[0].Outputs[?OutputKey=='FunctionUrl'].OutputValue"
# aws cloudformation describe-stacks --stack-name ChatticusWebDevelopment \
#   --query "Stacks[0].Outputs[?OutputKey=='CloudFrontDistributionDomainName'].OutputValue"

# export CHATTICUS_DEVELOPMENT_BASE_URL=
# export CHATTICUS_STAGING_BASE_URL=
# export CHATTICUS_PRODUCTION_BASE_URL=
